    'hist.h1' => ['en'=>'History','cy'=>'Hanes'],
    'hist.p1' => ['en'=>'The Department was established in 1951 upon the observation that coincidence alone proved an insufficient explanation.','cy'=>'Sefydlwyd yr Adran ym 1951 ar sail yr arsylwad nad oedd cyd-ddigwyddiad yn ddigon o esboniad ynddo’i hun.'],
    'hist.p2' => ['en'=>'For generations, hours that failed to arrive were treated as private misfortune or as nothing at all. The Instrument of Establishment placed that misfortune in the public interest, limited the Department’s concern to demonstrable effects upon public life, and forbade any reading of the Codex as authority over the lawful passage of time itself.','cy'=>'Am genedlaethau, triniwyd oriau a fethodd â chyrraedd fel anffawd breifat neu fel dim byd o gwbl. Gosododd yr Offeryn Sefydlu yr anffawd honno yn fater o ddiddordeb cyhoeddus, cyfyngodd bryder yr Adran i effeithiau dangosadwy ar fywyd cyhoeddus, a gwaharddodd ddarllen y Codex fel awdurdod dros basio cyfreithlon amser ei hun.'],
    'hist.1951' => ['en'=>'The Department of Excess Time is established as an executive department. The Founding Codex is issued as internal publication DET-CODEX-001. Chapter 0 is the Founding Instrument. It has not been amended.','cy'=>'Sefydlir Adran Amser Dros Ben fel adran weithredol. Cyhoeddir y Codex Sefydlu fel cyhoeddiad mewnol DET-CODEX-001. Pennod 0 yw’r Offeryn Sefydlu. Nid yw wedi’i ddiwygio.'],
    'hist.1963' => ['en'=>'A field station is opened at Abercrave. It is not a public office. It remains a field station.','cy'=>'Agorir gorsaf faes yn Abercraf. Nid swyddfa gyhoeddus mohoni. Gorsaf faes ydyw o hyd.'],
    'hist.2008' => ['en'=>'The Chronometer Programme is opened. Instrument 13 is placed under civil oversight. The machine does not predict. It measures relation.','cy'=>'Agorir y Rhaglen Chronomedr. Rhoddir Offeryn 13 o dan oruchwyliaeth sifil. Nid yw’r peiriant yn rhagweld. Mae’n mesur perthynas.'],
    'hist.2526' => ['en'=>'Bristol, Manchester, Edinburgh and Belfast are closed due to budget reductions. Cardiff remains headquarters. Abercrave remains limited. The Codex is reset for contemporary issue. The text of Chapter 0 is unaltered.','cy'=>'Mae Bryste, Manceinion, Caeredin a Béal Feirste ar gau oherwydd toriadau cyllideb. Caerdydd yw’r pencadlys o hyd. Mae Abercraf yn gyfyngedig o hyd. Ailosodir y Codex ar gyfer cyhoeddi cyfoes. Nid yw testun Pennod 0 wedi newid.'],

