    'form.recognised' => ['en'=>'The Department administers consequences. It does not create causes. You will be contacted only if the record is recognised.','cy'=>'Mae’r Adran yn gweinyddu canlyniadau. Nid yw’n creu achosion. Cysylltir â chi dim ond os cydnabyddir y cofnod.'],
