    'pub.body.fallback' => ['en'=>'This document is issued for officers, partner organisations and authorised researchers. Printed copies may be requested from Records, Cardiff.','cy'=>'Cyhoeddir y ddogfen hon ar gyfer swyddogion, sefydliadau partner ac ymchwilwyr awdurdodedig. Gellir gofyn am gopïau printiedig gan Gofnodion, Caerdydd.'],
    'pub.html.note' => ['en'=>'HTML publication. Print copies may be requested from the Cardiff public counter. Catalogue mark TTG-13 is retained with the file.','cy'=>'Cyhoeddiad HTML. Gellir gofyn am gopïau printiedig yn y cownter cyhoeddus yng Nghaerdydd. Cedwir marc catalog TTG-13 gyda’r ffeil.'],
